    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Moderate CYP2C9 and CYP3A4 inhibitor and strong CYP2C19 inhibitor: monitor narrow-therapeutic-window drugs metabolized this way; the effect persists 4 to 5 days after stopping."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
