      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Rare serious hepatotoxicity, usually but not always reversible on stopping: use with caution in liver dysfunction; stop if signs of liver disease develop."
     }
    ]
   }
